'" Graphics pipeline example `graphics_pipeline.cpp`
@startuml graphics_pipeline
title Graphics pipeline: transform -> project -> raster
actor Application as App
participant "Example (graphics_pipeline)" as Example
participant "microla::Matrix4" as Mat4
participant "Renderer/Host" as Renderer

App -> Example: run()
Example -> Mat4: build model, view, projection matrices
Example -> Mat4: multiply to obtain MVP
Example -> Renderer: transform vertices with MVP
Renderer -> Renderer: perform clipping & rasterization (host or external)
Renderer -> App: draw frame

note right
  Shows typical use of matrix transforms in rendering pipelines
  Emphasizes fast, small-matrix multiplications
end note
@enduml
